          "settings": {
            "collapsible_tab_heading": "Product Information",
            "collapsible_tab_text": "<p><strong>The Autonomous Estate. By Yard Automation Pros.</strong></p><p><strong>Fall clearing, zero effort.</strong></p><p>The Leaf Blower module attaches to your Yarbo Core and turns it into a high velocity clearing machine that handles leaves and debris across your entire property, fully autonomous.</p><p><strong>Requires a Yarbo Core to run.</strong> This module needs a Core base to operate. If you don’t already own one, a bundle like the <a href=\"https://bz1drk-tc.myshopify.com/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> includes a Core and gets you running immediately.</p><h3>Clear it all, automatically</h3><p>High velocity airflow moves leaves and debris fast, covering the whole property without you lifting a finger.</p><h3>Works with the Core’s navigation</h3><p>The module relies on the Core’s RTK positioning and multi-sensor fusion to cover every corner of your property consistently, with no missed patches.</p><h3>Specifications</h3><p><strong>Module type</strong> Leaf Blower. <strong>Compatible base</strong> Yarbo Core. <strong>Airflow</strong> High velocity clearing. <strong>Connectivity</strong> Managed through the Yarbo app via the Core.</p><h3>Ownership, handled</h3><ul><li><strong>Delivery.</strong> Typically about two weeks after your order.</li><li><strong>Covered by Yarbo’s 2 year manufacturer warranty</strong> on defective parts, excluding consumables, from your activation date.</li><li><strong>Curated and supported by Yard Automation Pros,</strong> before and after the sale.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
