      "blocks": {
        "question_nCTWbR": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does the Leaf Blower module work with any Yarbo Core?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, any standard Yarbo Core. If you’re starting fresh, the <a href=\"https://bz1drk-tc.myshopify.com/products/yarbo-lawn-mower-pro-core-lawn-mower-pro-module\">Lawn Mower Pro bundle</a> brings the Core and a module together to get you running immediately.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_69jhiF": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How much area can it clear in one session?",
            "answer": "<p>An entire property, handled in a single autonomous run. High velocity airflow moves leaves and debris fast, with no rake ever leaving the shed.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_8KCdGW": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does it take to attach the module?",
            "answer": "<p>Minutes, not tools. Lock the Leaf Blower onto your Core and the Yarbo app walks you through calibration and airflow settings, then fall is handled.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_EcA6Mx": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can it run in wet or windy conditions?",
            "answer": "<p>Light rain is no concern, rain sensors and IPX waterproofing see to that. In more severe conditions, it pauses, returns to shelter, and resumes once the weather clears.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_JjXiyk": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does it work on sloped or uneven yards?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Built on the Core’s tracked chassis and 70% (35 degree) climbing ability, slopes and rough terrain are simply part of the job here.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "question_JxkamV": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What support and warranty do I get?",
            "answer": "<p>Yarbo’s 2 year manufacturer warranty on defective parts, excluding consumables, backed by our US based support team for setup and every question that follows.</p>",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
